      "held_out_intercept_adjusted_mean_rel_error": "uses held-out sigma_0 (leaks intercept; NOT blind)",
      "held_out_k_y_rel_diff": "slope-only: |k_y_sim(calibrated) - k_y_held|/k_y_held; no intercept used; k_y_held is only the comparison target"
    },
    "v15_band": "v15_within_25pct_band = (headline unadjusted mean rel error <= 0.25); may be False.",
    "held_out_data_status": "verified_fits rows only; reconstructed hall_petch_datasets.csv rows are demonstration_only and never used here. tau_c_pa is unused when sigma_0_offset_pa is given; ferritic tau_c (needs_citation) therefore does not enter any result."
